cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MolFlood in scientific work, please cite this software and the specific version used."
title: "MolFlood: Docking Score Prediction Pipeline"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Tarouco"
    given-names: "Davidt"
  - family-names: "Pedebos"
    given-names: "Conrado"
  - family-names: "Ligabue-Braun"
    given-names: "Rodrigo"
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - docking score
  - machine learning
  - virtual screening
  - neglected diseases
  - understudied diseases
  - cheminformatics
abstract: >-
  MolFlood is a reproducible machine-learning workflow for predicting docking
  scores from molecular structure, with emphasis on therapeutic targets
  associated with neglected and understudied diseases.
